  "goodToKnow": "Der Seitensprung is an act of infidelity, usually a one-off fling: einen Seitensprung haben, beichten (confess). Literally, a jump to the side. The everyday verb is fremdgehen (to cheat): Er ist fremdgegangen. A longer relationship is eine Affäre. Germany abolished adultery as a criminal offence in 1969, and since 1977 divorce has been based on breakdown of the marriage, not fault. Plural: die Seitensprünge."
